==Release information==
This card was one of five cards that could be pulled from Promo-A Vol. 5 packs; these were made available as part of the [[Gible Drop Event]], which ran from March 3 to 17, 2025.

==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Guardians Rising|Nosepass|69}} from the {{TCG|Guardians Rising}} expansion.
*{{m|Iron Defense}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Nosepass}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

